{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John in Brazil"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Time To Celebrate"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Celebrating Important Occasions > Carnival"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "  Which One is It? - Festival, Holiday or Vacation"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " These are words related to festivals, holidays, or celebrations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Holiday</span>:<br />  Holiday is a contraction of the words \"holy\" and \"day\". They were special religious days.<br /> Types of holidays: <ul><li>Most holidays are based in religion.</li><span class=\"italic\">Example: Christmas</span><li>Non-religious holidays can be national or international.<br />  <span class=\"italic\">Example: Independence Day</span></li>   </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Festival</span>:<br />    A festival is an event. It is usually based in the community. There are numerous types of festivals in the world. Festivals can have religious origins,  be based on changes of the season or have some cultural importance."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Vacation</span>:<br />    Vacation is a  period of recreation, away from work. You can sometimes  spend your vacation time away from home."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "opportunity "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a situation where it is possible to do something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's a great opportunity to learn about other cultures and traditions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to describe a festival."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "float "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a vehicle with a platform used to carry an exhibit in a parade "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:The wood floats are covered with decorations."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rhythm "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a regular, repeated pattern of sounds  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The rhythm of the music was great."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reveler "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person celebrating in a wild and noisy way "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Revelers fill the streets, dancing and singing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "enticing "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "tempting; attracting someone by offering something appealing  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The beat of the music is so enticing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "costume "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "clothes that you dress up in  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The costumes on the dancers are fantastic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "full of life "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "lively; energetic "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Everyone at the parade is full of life."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le06ob04aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le06ob04re1img01.png"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, write a 10-line dialogue between you and your friend about a festival in your area. What is the festival for?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include 4 words with the <span class=\"italic\">ou</span> sound like <span class=\"italic\">would</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about a festival and its background."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about the festival."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice words with the <span class=\"italic\">ou</span> sound."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le06ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le06ob04re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le06ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Everyone should join the Carnival Festival in Rio de Janeiro.This is the world's largest party!<br /><br />\nI'm having a really good time in Brazil.  Everyone is so friendly, fun and full of life.  Plus, there are people here from around the world. It's a great opportunity to learn about the culture and traditions of Brazilians.", "id": 1, "time": "500", "image": "engenn4le06ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "The costumes on the dancers are fantastic.The wood floats are covered with decorations and people from Samba schools moving to the rhythm. The beat of the music is so enticing.", "id": 2, "time": "21000", "image": "engenn4le06ob04re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "Revelers fill the streets, dancing and singing. I'm not the best dancer but the music makes me even want to try the Samba! I'd love to come back again and bring my friends. Peter, Sally and Vanessa would love this! I should take more pictures to show them later. This is an experience of a lifetime.", "id": 3, "time": "33000", "image": "engenn4le06ob04re2img04.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can say and use the ou sound like would. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can describe celebrations and festivals. "}, {"type": "Learning 